  "notes": "{加|くわ}わる means to join a group or for something to be added—an intransitive verb describing the act of becoming part of something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Pair: {加|くわ}える (transitive, to add something)\n\nPATTERN:\nXに{加|くわ}わる: to join X\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- グループに{加|くわ}わる: to join a group\n- チームに{加|くわ}わる: to join a team\n- {議論|ぎろん}に{加|くわ}わる: to join a discussion\n- {力|ちから}が{加|くわ}わる: force is added\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {加|くわ}わる: to join (intransitive)\n- {参加|さんか}する: to participate",
